1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Sahay builds a personal study roadmap on this phone. It has no internet permission.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Choose your goal, experience, weekly hours, deadline, interests and language.

3
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:30,000
The diagnostic records answers, confidence, response time and hints.

4
00:01:30,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The learning engine orders prerequisites and explains every change to the plan.

5
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Explanations use the source note. Template output is labelled when the model is unavailable.

6
00:02:40,000 --> 00:03:15,000
The dashboard shows mastery and confidence. Recovery lists dropped skills and reasons.

7
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Review scanned text before generating. Scan every QR page to transfer the complete record.

8
00:03:50,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Device readings are measured locally. Export or delete your data in Settings.

9
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Airplane mode stays on. We report only measured results and identify unfinished prototypes.
